{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52439","headline":"回波乐 八十二 · 王梵志","name":"回波乐 八十二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"身（项校「闻」）强被（一作「避」）却罪，修福只心懃。\n专意涓涓念，时时报佛恩。\n得病不须卜，实莫浪求神。\n专心念三报（一作「宝」），莫乱自家身。\n十念得成就，化佛自迎君。\n若能自安置，抛（一作「块」）却带囚（一作「田」）身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52439.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52439","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}